# Repeats count by trick id: kickflip and heelflip in turn, three of each in one vert air, are each
# 100, 75, 50: 450, x6 = 2,700 (six kickflips are 1,620: lab-repeat-curve).
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 15.5
tap flip+left 132
tap flip+right 179
tap flip+left 226
tap flip+right 273
tap flip+left 320
tap flip+right 367
run 600
expect event trickEnd{trick=Kickflip} count == 3
expect event trickEnd{trick=Heelflip} count == 3
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + Heelflip + Kickflip + Heelflip + Kickflip + Heelflip,points=2700,multiplier=6} within 436..440
expect no event bail
